// Screenshots supplied by the project owner, embedded as data URIs so the
// pages are self-contained (the GitHub connector used to publish this site
// cannot push binary image files). To replace a screenshot, regenerate its
// data URI from the new image file, or swap the constant for a file path
// such as '/images/settings-general.png' once the image lives in public/.

